work and doc-searching on my part)  I'm compiling Gnu Chess as I write
this.  Several people are logged into a MUSH which also runs nearly 24
hours/day on this system.  Unix does what I need, and it's doing it
all for free.  (Discounting the cost of the computer, which would be
near the $1000 mark today -- 386 DX with 8 megs, 200 megs HD, ...)  I
